WEBVTT

00:03:01.944 --> 00:03:05.377
"Before I die, I want
to be tried for piracy."

00:03:05.401 --> 00:03:11.845
(Laughter)

00:03:12.201 --> 00:03:16.391
"Before I die, I want to straddle
the International Dateline."

00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.470
"Before I die, I want
to sing for millions."

00:03:22.979 --> 00:03:25.702
"Before I die, I want to plant a tree."

00:03:28.727 --> 00:03:31.631
"Before I die, I want
to live off the grid."